    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "本教材的历史叙述称，在考察很深的海洋时就要用**深海探测器和海底潜水考察箱**。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 129,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "在考查很深的海洋时就要用**深海探测器和海底潜水考****察箱**.",
      "changes": [
        "layout",
        "language-modernization",
        "clarification"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
